    noodle:['Move the bowl under any falling food. On a phone, touch where you want the bowl to go and slide your finger to steer; on a computer, use ← → or A / D.','Every food item counts. Catch the number shown in the level meter to finish the round. There is no ingredient order to memorize. Random gold coins are worth a Bite Point each.','Avoid the red chili bombs. A caught bomb costs one heart; missed food is harmless. You have 3 hearts, and clearing a level restores one.','Each level asks for more food and increases the fall speed. Every tenth round adds a chili storm and an AI boss. Clear all 100 levels.'],
    match:['Tap or click any two cards to reveal their dishes. On a keyboard, use the arrow keys to move the gold frame and press Enter to flip.','A matching pair stays face up. A mismatch flips back after a short pause, so remember where each dish was hiding.','Match every pair before you run out of moves. Wrong pairs cost a move; the number of pairs and dish choices grows as levels get harder.','Use Peek, Shuffle, or Second Chance. Boss rounds tighten the move limit and add a dish pair when there is room. Clear all 100 levels.'],
