    lantern:['The snake moves forward automatically. Use arrows or W A S D to turn at right angles; do not turn back into yourself.','Collect the glowing dumplings to grow. Random gold coins are bonus Bite Points and are not required to finish.','Collect the target number to open the gate at the far edge. Then steer the snake through the glowing doorway to clear the level.','The platform has solid edges. A crash costs one heart and resets the snake, but dumplings already collected stay counted. Levels get faster, and every tenth adds two extra dumplings. Swipe or use the direction pad on touch screens.'],
    teatoss:['Slide the paddle with ← → or drag it across the lower part of the playfield. The ball launches automatically.','Bounce the ball into the blocks. Some shattered blocks release a glowing power-up; catch it with your paddle before it falls away. Gold boss blocks take extra hits.','A missed ball costs one heart and launches a fresh ball. Break every block to clear the level.','Later rounds add rows, tougher blocks, and faster ball speed. Paddle Extend and Slow Ball powers help you set up shots. Clear all 100 levels.'],
    sugar:['Run left or right with ← → or A / D. On a tablet, hold the left and right buttons below the playfield.','Jump over gaps and rolling pins with Space, ↑, W, or the JUMP button. You can steer while airborne to land on the next bakery ledge.','Collect enough glowing toppings to unlock the red-and-gold exit gate; extra toppings are optional. Then reach the gate. A rolling-pin hit or fall costs one heart, while collected toppings stay collected.','Every tenth level adds a rolling-cake boss and a longer rooftop course. Whipped Cream recharges your midair jump, Caramel Shield blocks one hit, and Sprinkle Magnet pulls toppings toward you.'],
    mooncake:['Tap, click, or press Space / Enter when the moving layer overlaps the stack below. A clean landing adds another layer; the unused overhang is trimmed away.','Keep the remaining layer at least 28 pixels wide. A near miss costs a heart and resets the moving layer to the current tower width.','Stack the target number of layers to finish. Each level asks for more layers and makes the slider faster; the tower stays centered as it grows.','Use Sesame Slowdown, Extra Dough, or Golden Tray. Every tenth level is a boss round with a faster slider and a taller target.']
